\u2014 by transport, not by choice", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "D1's HTTP API exposes one statement per request: no BEGIN and no parameterized batch. The journal stays correct because concurrency never depended on the transaction \u2014 appends are contiguous from the head, so two writers try the same first sequence number and the loser fails on its first insert. The cost is that a connection failure mid multi-event append leaves the already-written events written.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_unverified_against_real_d1", "label": "Unverified against real D1", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "No D1 container image exists and locally it lives only inside wrangler/Miniflare, so the transport layer (auth, response envelope, rate limits, error reporting) has no live integration suite \u2014 only the shared SQL, the contract suite against a fake, and unit tests against a stubbed fetch.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_d1journal", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_overview_journal", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_d1snapshotstore", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_overview_snapshotstore", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_loca